#: CHANGELOG.md:20
msgid "Keep the status window focused through the install (fixes #30)"
msgstr "在安装过程中保持状态窗口的焦点 (fixes #30)"

#: CHANGELOG.md:8
msgid "Run one copy of the app, so a reopened app cannot ruin a recording"
msgstr "应用只运行一个实例，重新打开应用不会再破坏正在进行的录制"

#: CHANGELOG.md:14
msgid "Skip the UAC notice when Windows will not ask, and keep the update focused"
msgstr "当 Windows 不会请求权限时不再显示 UAC 提示，并且更新窗口始终保持焦点"

